# Template for secrets.env (the real file is gitignored). Upload with: bash scripts/sync-secrets.sh
# One [section] per GitHub Environment. Add a new section to add a new environment.
# No quotes, no spaces around "=". Lines with an empty value are skipped.
# API_BASE_URL, WS_URL and PAM_URL MUST end with a trailing "/" (the code appends paths directly).

# Repository-level fallback: used by any environment that doesn't define the same name itself
